-encryptstrings Encrypts sensitive strings embedded in the application to reduce exposure of hardcoded information through reverse engineering.
-encryptclasses Encrypts or protects application classes to make unauthorized code inspection and reverse engineering more difficult.
-encryptresources Encrypts application resources to mitigate unauthorized resource extraction and analysis.
-obfuscatecode Obfuscates application code to impede reverse engineering and make security-sensitive implementation details harder to understand.
threatcastapikey Protects the ThreatCast API key configuration to reduce the risk of unauthorized use or exposure of the security service credentials.
